From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:28:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Do not wait for POI data on the region thread

Behaviours that re-read a remembered job site or bed went through PoiManager#getOrLoad, which blocks the region thread on disk I/O when the POI chunk is not loaded. They now skip that tick and keep the memory. The search of AcquirePoi can stay off the disk with performance.poi-searches-load-chunks in config/tessera.yml (default true, vanilla behaviour).

Fixes PaperMC/Folia#292

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/behavior/AcquirePoi.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/behavior/AcquirePoi.java
index e2eb02d8a0a9481be2308c9052582591bc4f9850..2e7e930a2f1835a3eb2c76f28a711b1c8dc6c2b2 100644
